  {to:"m10-n12", why:"A hard, fixed, painless node is a referral trigger; a soft, tender one is reviewed after the source is treated."},
  {to:"m05-n02", why:"Reactive lymphadenitis is the lymph node version of acute inflammation: the same vascular and cellular steps."}
